          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1314884}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">狩猎跃击</div><div class="s">多刺的迅叶龙瞬发扑人 + 连续锥形物理撕裂</div></div></div>
