          </div>
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1250937}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>喷毒（无清毒轮）</div><div class="s">清毒图腾冷却中的后续喷毒 · 吃满 9 秒跳伤合计约 190 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span></div>
            <div class="why">清毒图腾冷却中的下一轮喷毒，毒落地后立刻开星界，把剩余跳伤从约 32 万压到约 18 万（直击常规不开星界吃）；若清毒与星界都未就绪，立刻喊治疗驱毒并抬血。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1250199}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">蛤蟆卵 / 薯身蟾抽击</div><div class="s">主母产卵孵化幼蟾 · 幼蟾扑人约 19 万物理 + 击退</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">闪电链快清幼蟾</span><span class="or">可选</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:192058}}" alt="">电能图腾</span></div>
            <div class="why">幼蟾成群扑人容易打断读条并把人顶乱站位，出卵顺劈快清，聚怪时可扔电能图腾辅助控一轮。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1263628}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">尾王前 · 喷涌之花 / 门神小怪</div><div class="s">孢荒喷射者 / 光耀播法者 / 光噬鞭笞者 / 发光的棘喉兽（机制同前段）</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">转好且距多层球 ≥ 90 秒</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span></div>
            <div class="why">清完蟾蜍进尾王前，星界已转好且距预定接多层的球轮至少 90 秒才交在喷涌之花（未转好就满血喊治疗；若交得晚，进兹欧凯特后顺延到实际撞球满 90 秒的首个合适轮次再接多层，之前与队友分摊球数）。其余门神按前段断光箭雨、破授粉盾、躲棘喉兽炽阳吐息。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:383013}}" alt="">优先：清毒图腾与星界转移错开各包一轮喷毒；双技能空档提前喊治疗</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s8">下一段：兹欧凯特 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 4 兹欧凯特 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s8">
      <div class="node">4</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>兹欧凯特</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 4</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>全程每 3 秒全团<b>渗流木质</b>（约 26 万神圣），外加 <b>50 秒固定循环</b>（唤醒光绽 → 光绽精华吸球 → 棘刺 → 凝聚光线）。<b>开打前先分配好每轮全部光球的归属</b>；自己从实际撞球时刻距上次交星界已满 90 秒的首个合适轮次开始接多层，随后隔轮（约 100 秒）继续交，冷却未转好的轮次与队友分摊球数；土元素距鲁伊亚上次使用满 180 秒时，可作为无星界接球轮的常规备选补血量上限。高层常连带一只发光的棘喉兽和光噬鞭笞者进场，开打躲吐息并先破授粉盾。</div>
        <div class="subhead">一轮 50 秒循环（以唤醒光绽开始读条为 0 秒）</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row step" id="k-spore">
            <div class="when">0 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1246372}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">唤醒光绽 → 光孢射击</div><div class="s">3 秒读条催生光诞鞭笞者 · 2.5 秒读条单体神圣约 25 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:192058}}" alt="">电能图腾</span></div>
            <div class="why">小花出来立刻闪电链打进休眠，风剪紧盯光孢射击打断（同时续风幕给后面渗流木质和吃球减 15% 法伤），小怪聚拢时丢电能图腾群控防连射。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step must">
            <div class="when">+10 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1246858}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>光绽精华 → 光绽之力 / 渗流木质</div><div class="s">2 秒读条抽球飘向首领 · 撞球 12 秒增伤 +10%/层，后续撞球刷新持续并叠加每秒掉血</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span><span class="or">备选</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198103}}" alt="">土元素（≥ 3 分）</span></div>
            <div class="why">全队先分清每颗球归属，绝不漏球让它撞首领触发荧光迸发。吃 1 层每秒约 8 万可裸吃；叠到 2 层每秒约 15 万（接第 3 颗还会更高），再叠每 3 秒约 26 万渗流木质，预计连续接 2–3 颗球时在<b>首层掉血前后立刻开星界转移</b>（2 层压至约 9 万、3 层星界内仍约 14 万、渗流木质压至约 16 万），并留意<b>末颗球会刷新 12 秒减益</b>，星界到期后尾巴仍需满血交治疗刷。星界未转好的轮次与队友分摊球数（尽量只接 1 颗），土元素距上次满 3 分钟时可补在这轮拉血量上限。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">+22 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1247685}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">棘刺</div><div class="s">坦克方向击退 + 10 秒物理流血</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">别站首领正面</span></div>
            <div class="why">坦克专属机制，远程站侧后方输出即可。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">+36 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1246607}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">凝聚光线</div><div class="s">5 秒读条射线扫场 · 击中休眠鞭笞者化为光明树脂</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">躲射线与树脂池</span></div>
            <div class="why">配合坦克把休眠的光诞鞭笞者留在射线扫过路径上（没扫掉的下一轮唤醒光绽会带着邪恶愈合复活），自己避开射线和留下的光明树脂（减速 40% 且每 2 秒高额神圣），移位时开灵魂行者的恩赐保持输出。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：按实际接球满 90 秒隔轮交星界转移；冷却轮分摊球数，土元素满 3 分钟作备选</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#talent">查看天赋 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<section id="talent">
  <h2><span class="k">03</span>天赋</h2>
  <p class="sub">取自 +24 限时录像的元素天赋，英雄天赋先知。复制字符串，在游戏天赋界面点「导入」。</p>
  <div class="talent">
    <div class="code-row">
      <code id="talent-code">{{TALENT}}</code>
      <button type="button" id="copy-btn">复制</button>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-label">这四个防御与功能天赋不要动</p>
    <div class="tal-grid">
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:381647}}" alt=""><div><b>位面旅行者</b><span>星界转移冷却缩到 90 秒，全本六个高压点全靠它排得开。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1279819}}" alt=""><div><b>始源羁绊</b><span>土元素不再嘲讽，改为最大生命值 +15%，补星界空档。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{I:383013}}" alt=""><div><b>清毒图腾</b><span>2 分钟冷却，专治薯身蟾主母全团喷毒。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{I:355630}}" alt=""><div><b>风幕</b><span>风剪打断后 12 秒法术伤害 −15%，全本大量神圣/自然读条都能吃到。</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-note">常见可换：<b>幽魂步</b>（可秒解伊库兹血棘之根定身）↔ <b>阵风</b>；<b>大地之盾、元素环绕、塞拉赞恩的韧性、治疗链</b> ↔ <b>静电充能、图腾集中、图腾潮涌</b>（按队伍分工另可调整<b>雷霆之爪、妖术、陷地图腾、喷流</b>）；另常驻配有<b>自然守护者、元素防护、生机盎然、恩赐之魂、电能图腾、狂风图腾</b>。</p>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>元素萨满 · 夺目谷 应对手册 · 2026-11</div>
    <div class="refs">参考录像：
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/CG3RbAdqgMvt7nP4#fight=1">孤独咩 +24 28:22</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/1b9v7Z4FqkCwxpdX#fight=13">麦格拉斯蛮锤 +24 28:37</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/7m4kFCRwBnbYDQv6#fight=20">Hearthjacke +24 29:16</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/WBZyHQ26atmCArq1#fight=22">Bondd +24 29:24</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/cjDr17Nyhvf4MbX8#fight=10">Corysham +24 29:29</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
(function(){
  var btn=document.getElementById("copy-btn"), code=document.getElementById("talent-code");
  if(btn&&code){
    btn.addEventListener("click",function(){
      var t=code.textContent.trim();
      function done(){btn.textContent="已复制";setTimeout(function(){btn.textContent="复制";},1600);}
      function fallback(){var r=document.createRange();r.selectNodeContents(code);var sel=window.getSelection();sel.removeAllRanges();sel.addRange(r);try{document.execCommand("copy");done();}catch(e){btn.textContent="已选中，按 Ctrl+C";}}
      if(navigator.clipboard&&navigator.clipboard.writeText){navigator.clipboard.writeText(t).then(done,fallback);}else{fallback();}
    });
  }

  var links={};
  document.querySelectorAll(".nav a[href^='#']").forEach(function(a){links[a.getAttribute("href").slice(1)]=a;});
  var targets=Object.keys(links).map(function(id){return document.getElementById(id);}).filter(Boolean);
  function spy(){
    var y=window.scrollY+110, cur=targets[0]?targets[0].id:null;
    targets.forEach(function(el){if(el.getBoundingClientRect().top+window.scrollY<=y) cur=el.id;});
    if(targets.length&&window.innerHeight+window.scrollY>=document.documentElement.scrollHeight-4) cur=targets[targets.length-1].id;
    Object.keys(links).forEach(function(id){links[id].classList.toggle("on",id===cur);});
  }
  window.addEventListener("scroll",spy,{passive:true}); spy();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
